#: ../../ops/hub.rst:583
msgid "The operator token"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:585
msgid ""
"The token is read from the ``ADMIN_TOKEN`` environment variable and has "
"no default. An unset or empty token, or a placeholder such as "
"``CHANGE_ME``, stops the start. A token that appears in the project's "
"published source is accepted, but the process logs a warning at start and"
" every hour. Generate a random token of at least 32 hexadecimal "
"characters and keep it in a file readable by the service account only "
"(see :ref:`ops-deployment`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:599
msgid "Login and API access"
msgstr ""

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:601
msgid ""
"The console page at ``/admin`` is public; the login happens inside it. "
"The API under ``/admin/api`` is available only with the token as a bearer"
" credential. Failed credential checks, from the login route and from "
"bearer authentication alike, are limited to 20 per client address per "
"minute; further attempts receive ``429``. Requests that carry no "
"credential are answered with ``401``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:616
msgid ""
"The remote address is taken from ``X-Real-IP`` when present, so publish "
"the console only through a proxy that sets this header. A location block "
"for the console, to be placed in the TLS server block before ``location "
"/``:"
msgstr ""

